              "text": "പങ്കുവെക്കുക (paṅkuvekkuka) is native Dravidian, \"lay out in shares\": paṅku, \"part, share\" (DEDR 3808, with Tamil paku, \"to divide\"), and vekkuka, \"to put, place\" (DEDR 5549, with Tamil vai)."
